ion indicator to a specific location in a file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/io/fsetpos\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fsetpos</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   moves the file position indicator to a specific location in a file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/io/rewind\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rewind</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   moves the file position indicator to the beginning in a file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Error_handling\">Error handling </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><strong class=\"selflink\"><code>&lt;stdio.h&gt;</code></strong></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/io/clearerr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>clearerr</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   clears errors <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/io/feof\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>feof</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   checks for the end-of-file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/io/ferror\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ferror</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   checks for a file error <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/io/perror\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>perror</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   displays a character string corresponding of the current error to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/io/s